1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,236
Because the surface pulls inward, the pressure inside a curved surface is higher than outside.

2
00:00:06,236 --> 00:00:12,513
For a drop, or an air bubble inside a liquid, the excess pressure is two T over r.

3
00:00:12,513 --> 00:00:16,679
A soap bubble has two surfaces, so it is four T over r.

